From 65e0f2d3f7abdab84e961e3cff472cca58c25b66 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 17:29:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 262/262] spark-ds41f names: the deployment's variables are
 SPARK_DS41F_*

The deployment is spark-ds41f from the release after spark-ds41f-1022 (the
owner's decision of 2026-10-19), so the variables it sets for this tree drop
the old project name: SPARK3_* becomes SPARK_DS41F_*.

- DSpark: SPARK_DS41F_DSPARK_VOCAB_PARALLEL, SPARK_DS41F_DSPARK_MAIN_PROJ_TP,
  SPARK_DS41F_DSPARK_DEAD_ROWS_TAU;
- the display carve-out: SPARK_DS41F_DISPLAY_CARVEOUT_WEIGHTS and
  SPARK_DS41F_DISPLAY_CARVEOUT_CHECK_SECONDS;
- the indexer's split check: SPARK_DS41F_DS41_INDEXER_SPLIT_CHECK;
- disk Engram rows: SPARK_DS41F_ENGRAM_ROWS_TIMEOUT_MS, _READ_DELAY_MS,
  _CHECK_EARLY_IDS, _TIMELINE and _TIMELINE_DIR, whose default directory is
  /cache/spark-ds41f/engram-timeline.

The old names are not read: the recipe that sets the new names ships with the
image built from this tree, and an older image keeps the recipe it was
released with.

Tests: the Engram rows timeline test sets SPARK_DS41F_ENGRAM_TIMELINE.
